<title>USA: CTC signs marketing pact with Intermedia.</title>
<headline>CTC signs marketing pact with Intermedia.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CTC Communications Corp said Thursday it signed a non-exclusive agreement with Intermedia Communications Inc to market ICI's frame relay data services.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
